  "description": "People love AI, and AI loves tokens. But too many tokens can fill up the context window (boo!) and cost you a lot of money (double boo!).\n\nThat's why some guy named Johann invented a Token-Oriented Object Notation (TOON) to encode data with fewer tokens than JSON or YAML. This Pack lets you convert between JSON and TOON, as well as format and validate it.",
